[00:13.97] There’s no quick fix
[00:17.08] You gotta take your licks
[00:20.38] Strange times long lines
[00:26.74] There are no clean cups
[00:29.97] You gotta mess it up
[00:33.25] To see why you cry
[00:39.71] Chorus:
[00:43.87] I can’t stay home at night
[00:48.16] I’m drawn out like a moth to lamplight
[00:56.66] Do I speak or hold you tight?
[01:01.36] The words were voted out by a landslide
[01:16.42] Come on now
[01:19.35] You've got to try it out
[01:22.74] You’re killing time
[01:25.97] You’re killing mine
[01:36.15] Don’t go
[01:38.85] I’ll never know
[01:42.19] When you’re away
[01:45.48] I sleep all day
[01:48.95] Nothing works
[01:52.04] And thinking hurts
[01:54.04] You belong to me
[01:58.12] In my dreams
